  "report_markdown": "## Executive Summary\n\n- The Book of Esther (NIV) first mentions a place by name; the location of the events is present-day Iran. [6]\n- Ahasuerus was a great king of Persia.\n- Amīr ʿAbbas Hoveyda was the prime minister of Iran under Shah Mohammed Reza Pahlavi from January 1965 to August 1977. [9]\n- Hoveyda's tenure as prime minister ended in August 1977, meaning he was no longer prime minister in April 1977. [9]\n- The events of the Book of Esther fit chronologically between the 6th and 7th chapters of Ezra. [6]\n\n\n## References\n\n1. Esther 1 NIV - Queen Vashti Deposed - This is what - Bible Gateway — https://www.biblegateway.com/passage?search=Esther+1&version=NIV (document: web_search-5afffc51782c31c8)\n2. Esther 1 - NIV - This is what happened during the time of ... — https://www.biblestudytools.com/esther/1.html (document: web_search-02c841c39e109577)\n3. Book of Esther - Wikipedia — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Book_of_Esther (document: web_search-9b4b0ec7a51e5e81)\n4. Esther 1 Summary: 5 Minute Bible Study — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZxDtGKJNrGc (document: web_search-d1704e9dbe7c0f52)\n5. Esther 1 Summary: 5 Minute Bible Study — https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZxDtGKJNrGc (document: web_search-029b2345d8c00357)\n6. Esther 1 – Study Scripture Online — https://studyscriptureonline.com/sermons/esther-1 (document: web_search-03e6298f3b796068)\n7. Esther 1 - NIV - This is what happened during the time of ... — https://www.biblestudytools.com/esther/1.html (document: web_search-f53f285269073ec5)\n8. April 1977 Prime Minister Of Iran - Instagram — https://www.instagram.com/popular/april-1977-prime-minister-of-iran (document: web_search-75c32b165e0d67e8)\n9. Amīr ʿAbbas Hoveyda | Iranian, Shah, Pahlavi — https://www.britannica.com/biography/Amir-Abbas-Hoveyda (document: web_search-6f3d090520818aa5)\n10. List of prime ministers of Iran — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_prime_ministers_of_Iran (document: web_search-3226a35a8ca5e